      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Telecom Edge Computing</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-ink/70">A regional telecom operator needed to bring low-latency processing closer to subscribers across dispersed rural and urban sites. MEAICON designed and deployed edge computing infrastructure with remote management and security monitoring.</p>
